      "original": "ASTIS-authored compact scalar analytic background for omitted GaussianLSI; matches pinned SLT compact target with disclosed Bool-count alternative. It is not full noncompact/Hilbert GaussianLSI, Talagrand/T2, FIRST4.6, paper theorem/main, expected costs or composition. Signed and identically zero functions/zero mass are included.",
